;    4: TDecorate(count=1297, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かねざきつとむ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つちだ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ふけ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=22, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=らち, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はら, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=174, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=13464752, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=11465, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=10494, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow1_.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雪.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\雪道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>In this weather, the automobile could not be taken out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The snow kept piling up, higher and higher.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to get back down to the foot of the mountain quickly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My feet were losing the last of their feeling, and my fear of frostbite grew.<PG>
My pace quickened of its own accord.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The breath I let out grew thicker, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Faster, faster still.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Truly, today had been a miserable day.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Yes, today I had been through something terrible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed I had earned a great deal of resentment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, not from them alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sacrificed many lives.<PG>
At some point, had my heart gone numb as well?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The comrades who volunteered as test subjects were treated as things.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What are you doing here!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You thief!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What did you do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
When I learned the news of <STYLE ID="3">her</STYLE> death, I went at once to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what awaited me was abuse and intimidation from the residents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one raised a hand against me, but as the price of the research I had carried out, they had lost their <STYLE ID="3">Grand Witch</STYLE> and their cherries.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san's</STYLE> letter had said she would tell the residents how dangerous the Arata cherry was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But judging from their attitude, it seemed that had been left undone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My report is no doubt kept among the storehouse's books, but will it ever see the light of day again?<PG>
No, even a woman as clever as <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san</STYLE> needed a great deal of time to decipher those books.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Few people would think of rummaging through them of their own accord.<PG>
The Arata cherry―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is a name I gave it on a whim.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But according to <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san</STYLE>, it is apparently called Shigatsu Youka.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Many times in the past, it has attacked the settlement and driven it to the brink of destruction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet because of the way it lives, its true nature has never come to light, until today.<PG>
Yes, right now the only ones who know this are myself and the sect's leaders.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As things stand, there is no way to warn those residents of the danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is what I must do, the least I can do to make amends.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The least atonement I can offer, having sacrificed so many people and earned the residents' anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I have a duty to pass on <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san's</STYLE> will, her last wishes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow1_.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雪.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\雪道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But I will surely not be permitted to set foot in the settlement again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However I might try to persuade them, I cannot imagine they would listen. Still, the falsificaso should most likely have spared them from infection by Shigatsu Youka.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I confirmed that in the letter from <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san</STYLE>.<PG>
But there is more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Things I could not fit into my report.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have a duty to tell them those things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only to repay <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san</STYLE>, who cooperated with us, I will carry on her will to protect the residents of Arata.<PG>
But I had to deal with the problem in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to reach the foot of the mountain like this, without freezing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lights were gradually coming into view, so I was not likely to end up frozen to death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, I do hate the cold.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will hurry home.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But the sect did not last long.<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
We exploited the believers' goodwill to experiment with Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, to begin with, being able to use Droga was a great honor for a believer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why I, too, recruited believers who would cooperate with the experiments out of goodwill.<PG>
But gradually Droga's true form began to show, and a believer who had fled the experiments blew the whistle from within.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, the sect could hardly survive in such a state, and what Droga, supposedly a sacred implement, really was needs no saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, it was clear that the Droga we had held to be a sacred implement was a trap of Shigatsu Youka's, and the sect's doctrine no longer meant anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Holy Cerejeira Church swiftly ceased to exist.<PG>
But with that, I too lost my position.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to think about how I would support my family from then on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was shortly after that that I was summoned by the Director, one of the sect's leaders.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\パイプいす.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Change my family register?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="4">Shinozaki-kun</STYLE>, if you're going to keep living in this country from here on, there's no other way."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the last order I received from the Director.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'Change your name.'<PG>
The Holy Cerejeira Church apparently had ties to the Japanese government as well, so changing my family register was likely possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there were also affairs, such as building the railway, in which large sums of government money had changed hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The possibility that my personal details were known too, since I had claimed to be from the government, could not be ruled out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If a former believer were to take us to court, what would become of my family, let alone me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That, presumably, was what changing my family register meant.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Your</STYLE> name has already been decided. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's '<STYLE ID="5" RUBY="かねざきつとむ">Tsutomu Kanezaki</STYLE>.'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE> already have a residence in Iizawa Prefecture. 
{PAUSE ""}
Changing your name alone should probably be enough for the time being."<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE> will take a post at the prefectural office from now on. 
{PAUSE ""}
By the way... 
{PAUSE ""}
I read <STYLE ID="4">your</STYLE> report with great interest myself. 
{PAUSE ""}
The Arata cherry―
{PAUSE ""}
I see. If you analyze Droga scientifically, it's no drug of God, just a tool for a fungus to breed, and to parasitize humans. 
{PAUSE ""}
To think that what our ancestors worshipped for hundreds of years would turn out to be that..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I did not want to believe it either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But I do not think the sect's thinking was mistaken. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">We began the scientific experiments on Droga for the sake of our comrades. If Droga could be mass-produced, every one of our comrades could gain the power of God. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So, to that end, the experiments...!"</STYLE><PG>
"I know. Nobody expected Droga to be that dangerous."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"We should have halted the Droga experiments the moment they were found to be dangerous, after all...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　So many of our comrades were sacrificed...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, it's just as <STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE> say."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"And yet you ordered the experiments to continue...! Why!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, the Director placed both hands on the desk.<PG>
"I'm sorry."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, just like that, he bowed his head to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Director, apologizing without a single excuse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Faced with that, I could say nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the ones he truly ought to apologize to were not me but the comrades who served as test subjects and gave up their lives.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Please stop. Even that no longer means anything."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Showing sincerity as the Director did is important, but if so, there is something I must do so that no further tragedy is repeated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, I might be able to get the Director's cooperation too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Director, I would like to tell the residents of the Arata settlement, who cooperated with us, the results of our research. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Most likely, the residents have not seen the materials I handed to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Arata's representative</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this, the Director finally raised his head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, that would be best. 
{PAUSE ""}
Our ancestors opposed the ban on Droga, left the Arata settlement, and founded the sect. 
{PAUSE ""}
The Arata settlement was the one in the right. We should do at least that much."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then I have a request. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I am to be made an official of Iizawa Prefecture, I would like you to put me in charge of managing the Arata district."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you mean by that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The Arata district, where the Arata cherry grows. As I wrote in my report, the Arata district must be made state-owned land and placed under the state's watch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If outsiders were to learn of Droga..."</STYLE><PG>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
I'll square it with the prefecture's upper ranks as 'the person in charge of the Arata district.' 
{PAUSE ""}
Naturally, they won't be told about the Arata cherry."<PG>
And so I went from a researcher of the sect to an official of Iizawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had a hidden face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While working as a prefectural official, I would carry on watching the Arata district and the Arata cherry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And when the time was right, I would tell the people of Arata the truth about Shigatsu Youka.<PG>
With only <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san's</STYLE> information, the limits on using Droga would not hold for long.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to go further, tell the people of Arata what I could not fit into that report, and destroy Shigatsu Youka.<PG>
But there was a big problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My face was known to the people of Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the time being, I could not even meet the people of Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Given how confidential the information was, sending a proxy to the Arata settlement would also be difficult.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had even thought of changing my face with plastic surgery, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\ちゃぶ台.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Plastic surgery...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, what do you think..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I talked it over with my wife, she made a plainly unhappy face.<PG>
My wife had also been a member of the sect, but the leaders had told me not to speak of my research even to my family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had only told my wife not to volunteer as a test subject.<PG>
"Do please reconsider. 
{PAUSE ""}
And besides, what would you say to the children?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Yeah. It won't do after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My wife tells me she loves both the man inside me and my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is no wonder she objects.<PG>
Besides, some of the children are already old enough to understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Changing my face is not so simple a matter.<PG>
Then I have no choice but to put off contacting the Arata settlement for now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while, because of <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san's</STYLE> last wishes, the residents will likely keep their hands off Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As time passes, I will age and my face will change, and the residents' memories will fade.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Meanwhile, I need to put the research results together further and set down in writing what the residents should do, so that even people without the knowledge can understand.<PG>
In other words, I will summarize the reports so far and add further observations.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The experiments until now have only investigated the ecology of the Arata cherry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cannot say I have fully written out what kind of threat it poses to humans.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The last letter <STYLE ID="3">Kikyo-san</STYLE> sent me will also be important material.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Several years passed after that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I reworked the materials on those research results so that, as far as possible, even ordinary people could understand them.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "Shadows_creeping.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\レポート2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Anyone who has read the storehouse's books to some extent should be able to understand this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What remains is how to get this to the people of the settlement and have them add it to the storehouse's books instead of throwing it away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Simply mailing it is no guarantee that it will be kept with care.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow I must make contact with the people of the settlement and have them accept it.<PG>
For that, I must keep track of the situation in the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And find someone in the settlement who will accept this report.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
