I pressed the bills into <STYLE ID="11">her</STYLE> hand as she stood there, startled and flustered.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Now <STYLE ID="11">she</STYLE> should be all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights I should have walked her to somewhere she could catch a taxi, but today of all days, I was in a hurry too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then―<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Grandpa</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A small boy's voice came from far up ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Home was only a few steps away now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant this voice was―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, Cha-bo! Did you come to meet me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I scooped up my grandson as he ran to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That even someone as sinful as I am should be blessed with a grandson like this is truly something to be grateful for.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Um...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my back, the voice of <STYLE ID="11">the woman from before</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\エリカ若い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"I found my wallet! I'll give this back to you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">The woman</STYLE> held out the 2,000 yen.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, is that so? I'm glad to hear it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But I've already given that to </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"That's not it...! The truth is, I never lost my wallet at all―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"In that case, when someone truly in need appears before </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please give this to them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Taken by an honest person like </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, these 2,000 yen must be content too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Well, then..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I walked on, still holding my grandson.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A lie like <STYLE ID="11">hers</STYLE> is a trifle compared with my sins.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than that, I want to praise her for finding the courage to confess honestly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">She</STYLE>, I am sure, will put the 2,000 yen to good use.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Grandpa</STYLE>, who was <STYLE ID="11">that lady just now</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">The lady just now</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　She looked like she was in all sorts of trouble, so I just helped her out a little."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\ちゃぶ台.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I opened the front door together with my grandson.<PG>
"Oh, welcome home. 
{PAUSE ""}
You are just in time. There is a telephone call for you from a Tsuchida-san."
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Tsuchida-san?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My wife handed me the receiver of the telephone in the entryway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The call had come at a remarkably convenient time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And from the Director, no less.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, hello?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="4">Kanezaki-kun</STYLE>, it's Tsuchida."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I glanced at my wife and grandson; they did not seem interested in the conversation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I waited for the two of them to leave before answering.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What is it? It is unusual for you to call me at home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry, but can you come out now? There's something urgent I need to talk about."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Yes, understood. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But I am sorry, today I cannot stay very long..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't worry. It'll be over quickly."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Director told me where to go and hung up at once.<PG>
I had been in touch with the Director about once every few months.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He always called me at my workplace, but this time he had called my home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the first time that had happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had to be a very urgent matter.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, I have to go out for a bit. I'll be right back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I told my wife that and left the house again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did not want to disappoint my grandson too much, and Director or not, I would have him finish as quickly as he could.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I hurried through the dim alleys.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was darker than before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet I had a bad feeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could the urgent matter be?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most likely something to do with the Arata cherry or the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, to be told at this late date that it was something urgent on that front, I could not guess what it might be.<PG>
And then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\県庁夜道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A presence behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just a presence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt a strong gaze, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not a feeble one like that of <STYLE ID="12">the woman from earlier</STYLE>, but a strong gaze.<PG>
When I turned around―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\hit_axe1大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\夜道赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was aware of a large blade passing before my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it took me some time to notice that its edge had bitten into my body.<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
What is this...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This man... 
{PAUSE ""}
I do not know him...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A man like this, I do not know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is this happening to me...!<PG>
Could it be... because of that rumor...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I have done nothing!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If you lost something through some twist of fate, it is not my doing!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my voice would not come out, and against my will, the blade, drawn out of my body, came swinging down at me once more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\hit_axe1大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$00002F" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, I lost consciousness―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
and never... 
{PAUSE ""}
woke again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without even being given time to think through what had happened―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I...<PG>
If I could have, I would have handed that report directly to the people of the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that, too, will never come to pass.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In case something should happen to me before it could be <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="かな">fulfilled</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had left a copy of that report with a junior of mine at the research institute.<PG>
<TXSPS>If ever they are exposed to the threat of the Arata cherry... 
{PAUSE ""}
then that...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But who on earth would do this to me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly summoned by the Director...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So... that is... how it is...<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
