{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\黒電話.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\reciever1.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Hello, this is Tsuchida. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, as planned. 
{PAUSE ""}
I have confirmed <STYLE ID="4">his</STYLE> death. 
{PAUSE ""}
To be honest, it pains me, but now that it has come to this, it cannot be helped."<PG>
"Yes, I understand. 
{PAUSE ""}
If these strange rumors kept spreading and <STYLE ID="4">his</STYLE> background became known to the public, we ourselves would be in danger too. 
{PAUSE ""}
It is exactly as you say. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, I promised a plea bargain behind the scenes and had <STYLE ID="4">him</STYLE> killed."<PG>
"That settlement... 
{PAUSE ""}
I see. As before, they are not to be given family registers. 
{PAUSE ""}
Certainly, if something happened, it would be troublesome to have the local police go into the settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
If they die, no one will know. If they are born, no one will know. 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, the bare minimum of social welfare will be enough for them."<PG>
"The research institute in Motoki-cho?
{PAUSE ""}
　Yes, most likely the crime was committed by manipulated corpses. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, thankfully that rumor has completely faded as well. 
{PAUSE ""}
But the Arata cherry ought to be studied continuously. 
{PAUSE ""}
At the proper time... 
{PAUSE ""}
Let me see, some 60 years from now, it would be good to build a research institute in Motoki-cho once more."<PG>
"However, should an incident involving that drug ever occur, it will have to be hushed up at once. 
{PAUSE ""}
If Droga were to become public, the order of the world would collapse. 
{PAUSE ""}
This is all to protect the order of the world. 
{PAUSE ""}
It is what <STYLE ID="4">he</STYLE> wanted too."<PG>
"Well then, I will take my leave. 
{PAUSE ""}
Those who know this information must be reduced as far as possible. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, I will take care of my own matters myself. 
{PAUSE ""}
Thank you for everything until now."<PG>
